ppets of the content.\n\nTo access the complete information about the 1-10 scoring scale and detailed review form criteria, I recommend visiting the official CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page directly at: https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\n\nThis should provide you with the full scoring rubric and all evaluation criteria for reviewers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"937facd1-3ff3-4809-b45a-58cd38966ef5","uuid":"4d088d6c-6dd8-4b63-8dc2-27e6b602d00e","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:06:39.312Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 instruction for reviews scoring scale 1-10 review form criteria","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_011EBw5hSVsr765hvN6exsyn","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference"},{"title":"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4468126/"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"THE JOURNEY FROM SUBMISSION TO SCORE","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11690306/"}]},"I found the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the search results only show information about desk rejection criteria and guidelines, not the specific 1-10 scoring scale details. Let me search for more specific information about the scoring rubric.",{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014qnVe3e4wZx7NaBMpuPXCy","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Re