{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RMbvHrEJ54U4uUkcgQtfck","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:2024.corl.org instruction reviews overall recommendation score\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Papers XX\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/papers-xx\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Call for Workshops\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-workshops\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Speakers\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/speakers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Program\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Awards\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/awards\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instructions for Presentations\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instructions-for-presentations\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Papers\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/papers\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2024 \"Instruction for Reviews\" page. The search results show information about the review process and instructions for reviewers, but the specific page content visible in the search results doesn't explicitly display an \"overall recommendation score\" section. \n\nSubmissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical, and results are judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and/or their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning. However, the specific scoring scale or overall recommendation scoring details are not shown in the search results provided.\n