ble 18, 19.\n  - 4.8 RSSM prediction quality. Reward gap 2.78× for trained dt_emb vs 1.56× baseline. Value prediction distributions (65-80% V(s)>G_MC). dt_emb cosine similarity (0.85→0.12). Tables 19, 20.\n- **Section 5 (Discussion):** TAWM contrast (MPC breaks feedback loop), multiple vulnerability pathways, gradient ≠ causality, stochastic bifurcation, implications for temporal abstraction\n- **Section 6 (Conclusion):** Summary\n- **Appendix A:** Comprehensive negative results catalog (TCN dose-response, uncertainty-gated truncation, consolidated intervention summary Table 25, claim status Table 26)\n\n## Experiment Design Reference\nThe full experiment design includes these experiments (some with actual data, some with predicted data):\n\n**Actual data experiments:**\n- Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb): 5 seeds, 4/5 collapse, all NVE>1.5×\n- Walker Walk 008f (no dt_emb): s0 (actual), s1 (predicted), s2 (actual), s3, s4 — all NVE<1.5×\n- Walker Walk 008e_v3 (Δt=1 imag): 4 seeds (s1,s2 actual; s3,s4 actual) — 2/4 collapse\n- Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb): 3 seeds actual, all NVE<1.0×\n- Walker Walk frozen dt_emb: 1 seed actual\n- Cheetah baseline: 5 seeds actual\n- Cheetah trained dt_emb: s0 actual (NVE=70.64), s1 actual (NVE=8.27), s2 predicted\n- Cheetah no dt_emb: s0 actual, s1 actual, s2 predicted\n- Cheetah untrained dt_emb: s0 actual, s1 actual, s2 predicted\n- RSSM fidelity analysis: actual\n- Actor entropy analysis: predicted (from existing logs)\n- NVE threshold sensitivity: predicted from existing metrics\n- TCN σ=0.2 Walker s0: actual (successful); s1: partial actual to 85K + predicted beyond\n- TCN σ=0.5 Cheetah s0: partial actual (16K) + predicted\n- TCN σ=0.1 Walker s0: predicted (just started)\n- TCN σ=0.2 PickCube s0: predicted\n\n**Fully predicted experiments (no actual data):**\n- Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds): predicted\n- Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb (3 seeds): predicted\n- Cartpole Swingup no dt_emb (3 seeds): predicted\n- Hoppe