{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KS7SgLtyxuevRAg63sCqHy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 event-gated-adaptive-horizon 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (101 个)\\n\\n- **exp_009a_baseline_walker_s2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_008e_v3_walker_s2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_008e_v3_walker_s1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_006**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008a**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008c**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008d**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_009c_008f_walker_s2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_006_fixed_dt2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_002_event_gated**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_029c_tcn_walker_s0_sigma01 | σ=0.1 tests the lower bound of effective TCN noise; if Walker σ=0.2 prevents CIVO and σ=0.1 does not, establishes minimum effective dose. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8). Three-point dose-response: σ=0.1 (this), σ=0.2 (success), σ=0.5 (oscillatory failure). | — | — | — |\\n| exp_031_tcn_pickcube_s0_sigma02 | TCN (Temporal Conditioning Noise, σ=0.2) on dt_embedding during imagination rollout will suppress CIVO in ManiSkill PickCube-v1, as it did in Walker Walk, by preventing the world model from overfitting to fixed dt signals. | — | — | — |\\n| exp_030c_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma10 | TCN σ=1.0 on Cheetah tests whether higher noise amplitude further suppresses CIVO. σ=0.5 (exp_030b) was negative with NVE peaking at 10.67@55K then declining. σ=1.0 should provide stronger temporal regularization. If NVE stays below 1.5 throughout training and eval_return ≥ baseline → TCN generalizes to Cheetah with appropriate σ scaling. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_029b_tcn_walker_s2_sigma02（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_029a_tcn_walker_s1_sigma02** (success): TCN σ=0.2 multi-seed validation (seed=1): replication of exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02 which shows NVE<1.0× and eval reaching baseline at 135K. Tests whether CIVO suppression is reproducible across seeds. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8) with TCN noise σ=0.2. If s1 also shows NVE<1.0× → TCN σ=0.2 is a robust intervention. ← 基于 exp_027_tcn_walker_s0_sigma02\\n- **exp_030b_tcn_cheetah_s0_sigma05** (negative): Cheetah CIVO intensity requires higher TCN noise; σ=0.5 may be the environment-appropriate dose (Walker σ=0.5 = overdose causing oscillatory CIVO, Cheetah σ=0.2 = underdose with NVE 1.903@55K). Tests whether TCN effectiveness is environment-dependent with σ scaling to CIVO severity. If NVE<1.5× and eval maintained → TCN is generalizable with environment-tuned σ.\\n- **exp_027_tcn_walker_s1** (negative): TCN σ=0.5 seed=1: Replication of exp_027_tcn_walker_s0 with different seed to verify that the NVE self-correction phenomenon (transient CIVO at 55K → NVE recovery to 0.83 by 75K) is reproducible across seeds, not a stochastic artifact. Same CIVO-inducing config (gate_fixed_dt=2, subsample_max_dt=2, imag_horizon=8) with TCN noise σ=0.5. ← 基于 exp_027_tcn_walker_s0\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 41 / 负向 24 / 失败 11 / 共 97\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nbjb1-40020: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_009d_baseline_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_009f_008f_walker_s1: 已被终止\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XfSWuKYrSAZbSpnCBCAjSh","session_id":"937facd1-3ff3-4809-b45a-58cd38966ef5","uuid":"fdb22dc3-b0d2-4115-a39e-bcafe5855322","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:09:22.836Z"}
