{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017wcWt6bfGz1eVzRLuvDfV5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both reviewers completed independently. Now executing the roundtable: cross-sharing findings, identifying convergence/divergence, and synthesizing the final report.\n\n**Roundtable Summary:**\n- R1 (Methods+Experiments): Overall 5/10, Soundness 6, Contribution 6\n- R2 (Novelty+Related Work): Overall 5/10, Soundness 7, Contribution 5\n- Strong convergence on all major issues\n\nKey convergence points: both flag (1) narrow environment scope, (2) TAWM contrast not empirical, (3) no viable solution, (4) weak CoRL relevance, (5) small seed counts. R1 is more critical on statistical rigor; R2 more critical on novelty positioning vs MBPO.\n\nNow compiling the consolidated report and submitting."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13891,"cache_read_input_tokens":72277,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13891},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"937facd1-3ff3-4809-b45a-58cd38966ef5","uuid":"611f92cd-fea2-4182-ad0a-3d2b5a7cf1c0"}
